        "event_id": "lite_evt_00111",
        "explanation": "At turn 3, the family reads back critical lab values (WBC 2.1, NEUT# 0.86) demonstrating the doctor has successfully guided a transition to actionable next steps for the febrile neutropenia episode.",
        "quote": "白细胞计数 WBC：2.1  这个“中性粒细胞绝对值”是不是 NEUT#？写的是 0.86"
      }
    ],
